+// `limitation` field to 160 bytes (see `controlExtensionText` in
+// prometheus_webui.js) and silently falls back to a generic placeholder if a
+// row exceeds that bound. Every row's combined limitation + suffix must stay
+// well under that cap; see the unit test that guards this budget.
